  "caption": "Mandarin garage rock, 1960s-revival style. A fuzz-drenched electric guitar riff; a reedy Farfisa-style combo organ stabbing chords; trashy, loose live drums with tambourine; an overdriven bass doubling the riff. Raw live-room recording with crunchy near-mono garage tone. Male mid-range voice, shouted and sneering, rough gang backing on the hook. 146 BPM, E major. Frantic, cheeky and out of breath. No polished pop-rock production, no pop-punk, no synths, no metal guitars, no autotune.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - fuzz guitar riff, garage drum fill, combo organ stab]\n\n[Verse 1]\n九十九朵紅玫瑰\n綁在機車後座上\n單子寫的是十二樓\n我按成了二十一\n\n[Chorus]\n九十九朵送錯樓\n櫃檯小姐說謝謝\n她已經插進水桶裡\n還拍照傳給她媽媽\n\n[Verse 2]\n我衝回二十一樓\n喘到一句話說不完\n她說這不是送我的嗎\n我說小姐真的不是\n\n[Chorus]\n九十九朵送錯樓\n櫃檯小姐不想還\n她說水都換過一次\n她媽媽也回了愛心\n\n[Bridge - fuzz bass and organ]\n我跑回店裡拿一把\n白白的滿天星\n跟她說這把才是妳的\n她笑著把水桶推過來\n\n[Chorus]\n九十九朵送到了\n十二樓的人在等\n她說花怎麼濕濕的\n我說它們跑了兩趟\n\n[Outro - fuzz riff, drums crash out]",
